# Force binary handling for these extensions so Git never applies
# line-ending (CRLF/LF) conversion to them — that conversion is what
# corrupted several images in this repo previously (bytes replaced with
# UTF-8 U+FFFD, inflating file size and breaking the image format).
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.avif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
